      "Whether capacity above 3.93M improves this completed recipe; CR-DYN-0012 remains gated behind NanoDreamer validation."
    ],
    "decision": [
      "Use these frozen terminal values as the formal Medium reference for NanoDreamer parity. Keep XLarge paused until the Nano Tokenizer, PPO, data/latent audits, Dynamics and real continuous demo all pass their own reference tolerances."
